p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0; margin-right:0; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"background-color:#fafafa; color:#000000; font-family:Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">११. प्राप्त रकम आयोजना बाहेक अन्य कार्यमा खर्च गर्ने गराउने छैनौ ।</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"flex-container mt-5\" style=\"display:flex\">\r\n<div class=\"item-auto\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto; margin-bottom:4rem; margin-left:4rem; margin-right:4rem; margin-top:4rem; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">....................................<br />\r\nतयार गर्ने</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"item-auto\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto; margin-bottom:4rem; margin-left:4rem; margin-right:4rem; margin-top:4rem; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">...................................<br />\r\nसचिव</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"item-auto\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto; margin-bottom:4rem; margin-left:4rem; margin-right:4rem; margin-top:4rem; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">...................................<br />\r\nकोषाध्यक्ष</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"item-auto\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto; margin-bottom:4rem; margin-left:4rem; margin-right:4rem; margin-top:4rem; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">...................................<br />\r\nअध्यक्ष</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '2023-01-23 05:55:56', '2023-01-23 06:12:34', NULL);
